                            "template_html": "<h2>Data Protection Officer</h2><p>As per Article 41 of the LGPD, we have appointed a Data Protection Officer (DPO). Our data protection officer details are as follows:</p><p class='f-text-highlight'>{{company_info_dpo_first_name}} {{company_info_dpo_last_name}}</p><p><a>{{company_info_dpo_email_address}}</a></p><p>Our DPO is empowered and responsible to conduct all activities required by the LGPD and the ANPD including:</p><ol type='i'><li>Accepting complaints and communications from data subjects, providing explanations and adopting measures;</li><li>Receiving communications from the ANPD and adopting required data protection measures;</li><li>Orienting our employees and contractors regarding practices to be taken in relation to personal data protection;</li></ol></br><p>You may reach our data protection officer at:<a>{{company_info_dpo_email_address}}</a></p><p>The protection of your personal data is of particular concern to us. We treat the personal data provided by you in the context of the use of our website and services confidentially and in accordance with the applicable data protection laws as well as this privacy policy.</p><p>In the following, we inform you in detail about which personal data we collect, for which purposes they are used, with whom we share data and which privacy rights you may be entitled to.</p>",
