                    "template_html": "<h2>{{title}}</h2><p>This DPF statement supplements and should be read in conjunction with our general privacy notice, which outlines the categories of personal data collected and processed by us, the purposes of such collection and processing, and the third parties with which the personal data is shared along with the purposes.</p><p>{{data_privacy_framework_program_covered}}</p>{{data_privacy_framework_us_bases_subsidiaries_TEMPLATE}}<p><span>In compliance with</span> {{data_privacy_framework_program_title}}, <span>our organization commits to resolve DPF Principles-related complaints about our collection and use of your personal information. Individuals from concerned region(s) with inquiries or complaints regarding our handling of personal data received in reliance on</span> {{data_privacy_framework_program_title}} <span>should first contact us at the following details:</span>{{data_privacy_framework_contact_information_TEMPLATE}}</p>{{data_privacy_framework_relevant_establishment_TEMPLATE}}<p>Moreover, in compliance with {{data_privacy_framework_program_label}},<p>{{data_privacy_framework_alternative_dispute}}</p></p><p>If your complaint cannot be resolved through the above specified channels, in certain circumstances, the DPF provides the right to invoke binding arbitration to resolve complaints not resolved by other means. Please see this DPF webpage for more information:<a href='https://www.dataprivacyframework.gov/s/article/G-Arbitration-Procedures-dpf?tabset-35584=2'> https://www.dataprivacyframework.gov/s/article/G-Arbitration-Procedures-dpf?tabset-35584=2</a>.</p>{{data_privacy_framework_details_of_choices_and_means_TEMPLATE}}{{data_privacy_framework_details_of_choices_and_means}}<p>{{data_privacy_framework_US_bodies_investigatory}}. {{data_privacy_framework_program_title}}</p>{{data_privacy_framework_US_bodies_investigatory_TEMPLATE}}",
                    "title": "Data Privacy Framework",
