                                    "template_html": "<div><h3>Opt-out preference signal detection</h3><p>{{company_info_company_name}} detects and honors opt-out consent preference signals as an exercise of consumer’s CPRA opt-out right to stop the sale and sharing of their personal information.</p><p><span>We recognize the GPC and the following opt-out consent preferences signals:&nbsp;</span><br/>{{cpra_other_optout_preference_signals}}<br/><span>as valid requests to not sell or share your personal information.</span></p></div><div><span>To turn on the Global Privacy Control and similar opt-out consent preference signals you must:</span><br/>{{cpra_other_consent_preference_signals}}<br/><span>For friction-less compliance you must:</span><br/>{{cpra_activate_frictionless_compliance}}<br/></div>",
