                                    "template_html": "<h3><strong>CPRA Specific Notice on the Financial Incentive Policy</strong></h3><p>{{company_info_company_name}} values your PI and your privacy. Thus, we are willing to share our success with you for your continued participation in allowing us to voluntarily collect/retain/process/sell/share your data and ethically use it as per our privacy policy.</p><p>The following categories of PI and sensitive personal information are collected from you and are retained, processed, sold and shared by us to help drive our services and innovation:</span><span>&nbsp;{{cpra_financial_incentive_policy_data_categories_collected}}</span></p><p><span>Currently, we are offering {{cpra_financial_incentive_policy_offering_right_to_collect}} for the right to sell and share and use your PI and sensitive personal information. This value has been calculated meticulously where we have considered all of the following factors:</span> <span>&nbsp;{{cpra_financial_incentive_policy_link_regarding_factors_for_amount}}</span>.</p><p>If you are interested to participate and earn from allowing us to use, sell and share your personal information for our business operations you can find out more information and sign up for the program by visiting the following {{cpra_financial_incentive_policy_link_to_program}}. You can always withdraw from the financial incentive program by visiting/contacting {{cpra_financial_incentive_policy_link_to_withdraw}}.</p>",
