ling disclosing personal information under the Federal Gramm-Leach-Bliley Act or the California Financial Information Privacy Act or the Federal Farm Credit Act of 1971;</li><li>You are collecting, processing, selling, or disclosing personal information pursuant to the Driver’s Privacy Protection Act of 1994.</li></ul></li></ol>",
