                    "template_html": "<h3>Informational use of our website</h3><p>a) If you visit our website for informational purposes only, i.e. surfing on our website without specifically providing personal data, we will process the following information about you. The information may include a limited amount of personal data:</p>{{data_processing_activities_informational_use_attributes}}<p>This information is processed to enable you to use our website (e.g. by adapting our website to the needs of your device or browser).</p><p>The legal basis for this data processing is Article 7(V) of the LGPD, as we need the information for the effective provision of our website, and Article 7(IX) of the LGPD, as the processing serves our legitimate interest in ensuring the stability and security of the website.</p>",
