            "template_html": "<h2>Your Rights</h2><p>As per Article 18 of the LGPD, you are entitled to exercise all of the following rights (either by yourself or a legally authorized representative) subject to all legal and circumstantial exceptions:</p><ol><li>Require (i) confirmation if your personal data is being processed by us, (ii) access to and/or duplicates of your personal data retained by us, (iii) receive the personal data concerning you, which you have provided to us, in a structured, commonly used and machine-readable format and (iv) transmission of your personal data from us to another controller;</li><li>Request rectification, removal, blocking, anonymization of your personal data;</li><li>Refuse to provide and – without impact to data processing activities that have taken place before such withdrawal – withdraw your consent to processing of your personal data at any time while being informed about the consequences of denying or withdrawing consent;</li><li>Request information about the public and private entities with which we have shared your personal data with;</li><li>Oppose the processing carried out by us based on one of the situations of waiver of consent, if there is noncompliance of any provision of the LGPD in that processing activity;</li><li>Request for a review of decisions made solely via automated processing of personal data if they affect your interests (including decisions intended to define your personal, professional, consumer and credit profile, or aspects of your personality).</li><li>Take legal actions in relation to any potential breach of your rights regarding the processing of your personal data, as well as to lodge complaints before the ANPD.</li></ol></br>{{rights_uses_data_subject_portal_TEMPLATE}}",
