            "template_html": "<h2>Data Processing Activities</h2><p><strong>We collect certain personal information to provide specific services and functionalities on our website.</strong></p><p>The following sections describe the different data processing activities we conduct on our website. The information particularly reflects the processing purposes, what personal data we process for this purpose as well as the legal basis for the processing.</p>{{data_processing_activities_manual_TEMPLATE}}{{data_processing_activities_datamaps_TEMPLATE}}{{data_processing_activities_information_use_TEMPLATE}}{{data_processing_activities_user_account_TEMPLATE}}{{data_processing_activities_user_contact_TEMPLATE}}{{data_processing_activities_news_letter_TEMPLATE}}{{data_processing_activities_blog_TEMPLATE}}{{data_processing_activities_apply_for_job_TEMPLATE}}<h2><strong><u>Documentation and Records of Processing Activities</u></strong></h2><p>In compliance with Article 37 of the LGPD, we maintain records of our processing activities in a safe and secure manner - especially if the processing of your personal data is based on grounds of our legitimate interests.</p><h2><strong><u>Consequences for revoking consent</u></strong></h2><p>To provide certain services and products on our website, we require you to provide us consent for processing of your personal data. If you do not provide us consent, we will not be able to provide you that particular service or product. If you revoke your consent after providing it, please note we shall have to discontinue providing you that service or product. Services and products which require your consent for data processing are listed as below:</p><h2><strong><u>Processing of sensitive personal data</u></strong></h2><p>We do not process sensitive personal data without obtaining your consent or unless the processing activity falls within any of the exceptional situations found within Article 11 of the LGPD. We also do not share your sensitive personal data with other controllers for economic benefit unless authorized to do so under the laws of Brazil.</p>",
