                        "template_html": "<h2>Processing of personal data of children</h2><p><h3><strong>Processing of personal data of Children and Minors</strong></h3></p><p>We are committed to protecting the privacy of children who use our website. This section explains how we collect and disclose personal data provided by children under the age of 13. Further, we provide information on the parental choices and controls.</p><p><h3><strong>How we use personal data collected</strong></h3></p>{{minors_personal_data}}<p><h3><strong>How we communicate with parents</strong></h3></p>{{minors_communicate_with_parents}}<p><h3><strong>How we allow children to make personal information available to others or how we share this data</strong></h3></p>{{minors_information_collected}}<p><h3><strong>Parental choices and controls</strong></h3></p>{{minors_parental_controls}}<p><h3><strong>Data Retention</strong></h3></p><p><span>The retention period for the personal data is:</span>&nbsp<span>{{minors_duration_data}}</span></br><span>Afterwards, it will be deleted, unless longer storage is required or justified by law.</span></p>",
