                            "template_html": "<div class=\"mt-4\"><div class=\"f-text-big-content f-text-semibold f-color-subtle-heading-gray mb-2\">CCPA Specific Annual Reports</div><div class=\"f-text-big-content f-color-subtle-heading-gray\">We collectively receive/buy/collect/sell personal information of over 10,000,000 California consumers annually. The following metrics showcase how many consumer requests we have received over the last year.</div><table class=\"f-consumer-request mt-3\"><thead><tr><th width=\"130\">&nbsp;</th><th colspan=\"3\"><div class=\"f-text-big-content f-text-semibold f-color-subtle-heading-gray\">Consumers requests received over the last year</div><v-divider class=\"my-4\"></v-divider><div class=\"f-text-medium-content f-text-semibold f-color-subtle-heading-gray mb-3\">Consumer requests complied with</div></th></tr><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th width=\"125\">Right to know</th><th width=\"125\">Right to delete</th><th>Opt-out</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"pr-3\">No. of requests</td>{{ccpa_sell_pii_of_consumers_compiled_requests_TEMPLATE}}</tr></tbody></table><table class=\"f-consumer-request mt-3\"><thead><tr><th width=\"130\">&nbsp;</th><th colspan=\"3\"><v-divider class=\"my-4\"></v-divider><div class=\"f-text-medium-content f-text-semibold f-color-subtle-heading-gray mb-3\">Consumer requests denied</div></th></tr><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th width=\"125\">Right to know</th><th width=\"125\">Right to delete</th><th>Opt-out</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"pr-3\">No. of requests</td>{{ccpa_sell_pii_of_consumers_denied_requests_TEMPLATE}}</tr></tbody></table><div class=\"f-text-big-content f-color-subtle-heading-gray mt-3\">A copy of the full annual consumer request report can be found here: {{ccpa_sell_pii_of_consumers_link_to_annual_metrics}}</div></div>",
