                                        "template_variable": "ccpa_sell_pii_of_consumers_denied_requests_TEMPLATE",
                                        "title": "What is the total number of consumer requests, received by the business last year, which were denied?"
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "input": {
                                            "key": "ccpa_sell_pii_of_consumers_link_to_annual_metrics",
                                            "placeholder": "Link to report",
                                            "type": "text",
                                            "value": ""
                                        },
                                        "title": "What is the link to your annual metrics report which includes number of consumer requests received by the business last year and median / mean number of days taken by the business to comply?"
                                    }
                                ],
                                "template_html": "<div class=\"mt-4\"><div class=\"f-text-big-content f-text-semibold f-color-subtle-heading-gray mb-2\">CCPA Specific Annual Reports</div><div class=\"f-text-big-content f-color-subtle-heading-gray\">We collectively receive/buy/collect/sell personal information of over 10,000,000 California consumers annually. The following metrics showcase how many consumer requests we have received over the last year.</div><table class=\"f-consumer-request mt-3\"><thead><tr><th width=\"130\">&nbsp;</th><th colspan=\"3\"><div class=\"f-text-big-content f-text-semibold f-color-subtle-heading-gray\">Consumers requests received over the last year</div><v-divider class=\"my-4\"></v-divider><div class=\"f-text-medium-content f-text-semibold f-color-subtle-heading-gray mb-3\">Consumer requests complied with</div></th></tr><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th width=\"125\">Right to know</th><th width=\"125\">Right to delete</th><th>Opt-out</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"pr-3\">No. of requests</td>{{ccpa_sell_pii_of_consumers_compiled_requests_TEMPLATE}}</tr></tbody></table><table class=\"f-consumer-request mt-3\"><thead><tr><th width=\"130\">&nbsp;</th><th colspan=\"3\"><v-divider class=\"my-4\"></v-divider><div class=\"f-text-medium-content f-text-semibold f-color-subtle-heading-gray mb-3\">Consumer requests denied</div></th></tr><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th width=\"125\">Right to know</th><th width=\"125\">Right to delete</th><th>Opt-out</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"pr-3\">No. of requests</td>{{ccpa_sell_pii_of_consumers_denied_requests_TEMPLATE}}</tr></tbody></table><div class=\"f-text-big-content f-color-subtle-heading-gray mt-3\">A copy of the full annual consumer request report can be found here: {{ccpa_sell_pii_of_consumers_link_to_annual_metrics}}</div></div>",
                                "template_variable": "ccpa_sell_pii_of_consumers_TEMPLATE",
                                "title": "Does your business receive, buy, collect, or sell PI of 10,000,000 or more consumers?"
                            }
                        ],
                        "template_html": "<h3><strong>CCPA Specific Notice</strong></h3><p>In the last twelve months, our company may have collected, used, sold and shared, for business purposes, personal information about you as described in this Privacy Notice. Each category of data may be used by our company or shared with third parties also as described in this Privacy Notice.</p><h3><strong>CCPA Specific Description of Rights</strong></h3><p>Our company provides users complete rights over their data in accordance with the California Consumer Privacy Act:</p><ul><li>Users can request to know PI collected, sold, shared, or disclosed about them by the company in the last 12 months.</li><li>Users can request to have PI collected about them by the company to be deleted.</li><li>Users can request the company not to sell PI collected about them.</li><li>Users can not be discriminated against by the company if they choose to exercise their data rights.</li></ul><p>For more information on how to exercise your rights refer to&nbsp<a href=\"/#/rights\">Your Rights Section</a></p>{{ccpa_verify_dsr_TEMPLATE}}{{ccpa_verify_opt_in_consent_by_guardians_TEMPLATE}}{{ccpa_financial_incentive_policy_TEMPLATE}}{{ccpa_sell_pii_of_consumers_TEMPLATE}}",
