                        "template_html": "<p>Individuals whose personal data is covered under the ambit of this DPF statement have the right to access their personal data processed by us, and to further correct, amend, or delete such information where it is inaccurate, or has been processed in violation of the Principles, except where the burden or expense of providing access would be disproportionate to the risks to the individual’s privacy in the case in question, or where the rights of persons other than the individual would be violated.</p><p>Additionally, our organization offers individuals the following specified means to limit the use and disclosure of their personal data.</p>",
