                        "template_html": "<h3><strong>Description of Rights</strong></h3><p><span><a>{{company_info_company_name}}</a></span> </span>provides users complete rights over their data in accordance with the California Consumer Privacy Act:</p><ul><li>Users can request to know PI collected/sold/shared/disclosed by {{company_info_company_name}} in the last 12 months.</li><li>Users can request {{company_info_company_name}} to delete PI collected about them.</li><li>Users can request {{company_info_company_name}} to correct PI collected and retained about them.</li><li>Users can request {{company_info_company_name}} not to sell or share PI collected about them.</li><li>Users can not be discriminated against by {{company_info_company_name}} if they choose to exercise their data rights.</li><li>Users can request {{company_info_company_name}} to limit the Use of their Sensitive Personal Information.</li></ul><p>For more information on how to exercise your rights refer to  <a href=\"/#/rights\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Your Rights Section</a></p><p>If you are an authorized representative exercising a rights request on behalf on a consumer, the procedure to do so is:</p>{{cpra_verify_dsr_TEMPLATE}}{{cpra_verify_opt_out_TEMPLATE}}{{cpra_sensitive_personal_information_extended_purposes_TEMPLATE}}{{cpra_verify_opt_in_consent_by_guardians_TEMPLATE}}{{cpra_financial_incentive_policy_TEMPLATE}}{{cpra_sell_pii_of_consumers_TEMPLATE}}",
